@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L3：发送确认超时为何返回 UNKNOWN（二期发送执行器版）

actor Caller
participant MessageTemplate
participant MessageSendExecutor as Executor
participant DefaultReliableMessageSender as Sender
participant RetryExecutor as Retry
participant MessageProvider as Provider
queue Broker

Caller -> MessageTemplate: send(confirmTimeout = 3s)
MessageTemplate -> Executor: send(PreparedMessageSend)
Executor -> Sender: send(prepared)
Sender -> Retry: execute(message-send)
Retry -> Sender: attempt #1
Sender -> Provider: provider.send(request)
Provider -> Broker: publish
Sender -> Sender: wait provider future up to 3s

... 3 秒到达但 Future 未完成 ...
Sender --> Retry: ProviderSendResult.UNKNOWN / TIMEOUT
Retry -> Retry: classify UNKNOWN
Retry --> Sender: RetryResult.NOT_RETRYABLE
Sender --> Executor: SendResult.UNKNOWN / TIMEOUT / CONFIRM
Executor --> MessageTemplate: SendResult.UNKNOWN
MessageTemplate --> Caller: SendResult.UNKNOWN

... 之后 Broker 可能才确认 ...
Broker --> Provider: confirmed at 5s
Provider -> Provider: complete future CONFIRMED

note over Caller,Broker
UNKNOWN 不是 FAILED。
超时只说明调用方没有等到确认，不能证明 Broker 没收到。
V1 默认不对 UNKNOWN 继续重试，避免重复业务消息。
end note
@enduml
